1
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:36,000
A Bewitching New Live-Action Movie!

2
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:06,000
Casper Meets Wendy is a family, fantasy, comedy film directed by Sean McNamara.

3
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:36,000
When a warlock threatens Wendy the Good Little Witch, she and her aunts hide out
at a resort where Casper the Ghost is vacationing with his uncles.

4
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Although Casper and Wendy are told ghosts and witches
don't get along, the two are kindred spirits!

5
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:36,000
This spooky family-friendly adventure finds Casper and Wendy bridging the
ghost-witch divide to battle the warlock who is intent on destroying Wendy.

6
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:06,000
Wendy, played by Hilary Duff.

7
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:36,000
Gabby, played by Shelley Duvall.

8
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Geri, played by Cathy Moriarty.

9
00:40:30,000 --> 00:40:36,000
Fanny, played by Teri Garr.

10
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Desmond Spellman, played by George Hamilton.

11
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
Casper (voice), played by Jeremy Foley.

12
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:06,000
Casper Meets Wendy is a 1998 American fantasy comedy film based on the Harvey Comics
cartoon characters Casper the Friendly Ghost and Wendy the Good Little Witch.

13
00:58:30,000 --> 00:58:36,000
The film is a standalone sequel to Casper: A Spirited Beginning,
and the second spin-off/prequel of Casper (1995).

14
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Saban Entertainment co-produced the project.

15
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
This was Hilary Duff's first major film, and was released on
September 22, 1998, six days before her 11th birthday.

16
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
The film also marks the second Casper film for co-star Cathy Moriarty, who
previously starred as the main antagonist in the 1995 film.

17
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
The film was met with mostly negative reviews from critics, but
was considered an improvement to its predecessor.

18
01:21:00,000 --> 01:21:06,000
Its television premiere was October 24, 1999 on Fox Family.

19
01:25:30,000 --> 01:25:36,000
The tone is lighthearted.
